      "short": "$(x-2y+1)^2$.\n\nRecognise $(x-2y)^2+2(x-2y)+1$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2+4y^2-4xy+2x-4y+1&=(x-2y)^2+2(x-2y)+1\\\\x^2+4y^2-4xy+2x-4y+1&=(x-2y+1)^2.\\end{align*}$$",
